# Display behaviours found by the differential fuzzer.
tags: display

=== listing-reprints-multiline-prompt
tags: complete prompt
screen: 33x8
--- script
complete_words "x"
set rl_completion_entry_function words
readline "two\nlines> "
--- keys
\M-?<snap>\r

=== hscroll-long-prompt-multibyte
tags: horizontal-scroll-mode utf8
screen: 20x6
--- inputrc
set horizontal-scroll-mode on
--- script
readline "a much longer prompt string> "
--- keys
語We3<snap>\C-a<snap>\r

=== byte-oriented-vi-append-after-multibyte
tags: byte-oriented vi utf8
screen: 40x10
--- inputrc
set editing-mode vi
set byte-oriented on
set keyseq-timeout 50
--- script
readline "日本> "
--- keys
ö\e<pause>A<snap>\r

=== byte-oriented-move-over-multibyte
tags: byte-oriented utf8 callback
--- inputrc
set byte-oriented on
--- script
callback "\001\e[1m\002bold\001\e[0m\002> "
--- keys
ж<left>\M-f<snap>\r

=== byte-oriented-insert-at-start
tags: byte-oriented utf8 callback
--- inputrc
set byte-oriented on
--- script
callback "日本> "
--- keys
al'ж6;5*w\C-atr<snap>\r

=== tab-after-wide-char-wrap-gap
tags: wrap utf8 visible
screen: 10x5
--- script
readline "> "
--- keys
1234567本\C-v\tx<snap>\r

=== prompt-invisible-after-second-row-start
tags: prompt wrap
screen: 20x6
--- script
readline "12345678901234567890123456789012345\001\e[1m\002ab\001\e[0m\002> "
--- keys
<snap>x<snap>y<snap>\C-a<snap>\r

=== prompt-invisible-only-start-at-third-row
tags: prompt wrap
screen: 20x6
--- script
readline "123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345\001\e[1m\002ab\002> "
--- keys
<snap>x<snap>\r

=== custom-redisplay-dumb-hscroll-edit
tags: rl_redisplay_function horizontal-scroll-mode
screen: 20x6
--- script
def rd
rl_redisplay
end
set rl_redisplay_function script:rd
readline "> "
--- keys
0123456789abcdefg<snap>h<snap>i<snap>\C-a<snap>\C-e<snap>\C-b<snap>\r

=== no-xenl-cursor-stays-in-last-column
tags: terminal wrap
env: TERM=ansi
screen: 20x6
--- script
readline "> "
--- keys
0123456789abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz<snap>\C-a<snap>\r

=== tab-at-wrap-point
tags: wrap visible
screen: 20x5
--- script
readline "> "
--- keys
0123456789abcdefgh\C-v\tx<snap>\r
